{"text": "Cabinet Vasseur Expertise Comptable\n14 bis, rue de la République - 24200 Sarlat-la-Canéda - Tél. 05 55 55 01 42\nSIRET 824 417 209 00031\n\nSarlat, le 12 novembre 2025\n\nM. et Mme ENTWISTLE\nLieu-dit Les Noyers\n24250 Domme\n\nObjet / Re: your 2025 file - Les Gîtes du Noyer - dossier n° D-2023-0418\n\nDear Graham, dear Patricia,\n\nVoici le point sur votre dossier. I write in English below, with the French terms you will see on the forms.\n\n1. Rental income (revenus locatifs). For the two gîtes you received 38 640,00 € between 1er janvier and 31 octobre 2025. You remain under the micro-BIC regime (LMNP). The amount to report on formulaire 2042-C-PRO will be about 46 000 € for the full year.\n\n2. Numbers you asked for:\n   - SIRET of the gîtes: 901 447 182 00014\n   - Your numéro fiscal: 30 24 418 772 091 (Graham), 30 24 418 772 106 (Patricia)\n   - Your space on impots.gouv.fr: the identifiant is the numéro fiscal; the mot de passe you gave me by phone, Dordogne2019!, should be changed.\n\n3. CFE. The avis for 412 € is payable before 15/12/2025. It will be taken from your account at the Crédit Mutuel du Périgord Noir, IBAN FR34 2604 6402 3594 0889 4661 008, BIC CMPNFR2AXXX.\n\n4. Residence. Your cartes de séjour (titre de séjour \"Article 50 TUE\", n° 9924041877 and n° 9924041878) expire on 03/02/2026. The préfecture asks for the last avis d'imposition; I enclose it. Your UK State Pensions (£11,502 and £8,814) are declared here but taxed only in the UK.\n\n5. The sale of the barn. Maître Julien Cazenave, notaire à Bergerac, needs your dates and places of birth for the acte: I gave him 4 July 1953, Rochdale (Graham) and 22 Sept. 1955, Oldham (Patricia). Signature is planned for mardi 9 décembre at 14h30. Price 92 000 €, of which 4 600 € deposit already held by Me Cazenave.\n\n6. Patricia: because of your long-term illness (ALD, 100 % cover), the home-help costs are not deductible twice; send me the attestation from the CPAM anyway.\n\nNOTE D'HONORAIRES 